<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P ups Banque Indosuez debt rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P ups Banque Indosuez debt rating.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said it had raised the long term debt rating of Banque Indosuez to AA from A+ and the short-term rating to A1+ from A1 after Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole took full control.</p>
</text>
